index 000000000..925476dc0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/news/2043.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix the parsing of leap seconds (``time-second = 60`` per RFC 5545): ``vTime.from_ical``, ``vDatetime.from_ical``, ``vTime.parse_jcal_value`` and ``vDatetime.parse_jcal_value`` now clamp the value to 59 like the xCal paths instead of raising a parsing error. @rahul05ranjan
